---
subject: "{{child_name}} wants to create a {{product_name}} account"
vars: [child_name, child_email, consent_url, privacy_summary_url, privacy_url, expires_at]
---
<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-preview>{{child_name}} wants to create a {{product_name}} account</mj-preview>
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" />
    </mj-attributes>
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body background-color="{{colors.background}}" width="560px">
    {{> header}}
    <mj-section background-color="{{colors.surface}}" border-radius="14px" padding="28px 8px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text color="{{colors.text}}" font-size="22px" font-weight="700" line-height="30px">Your approval is needed</mj-text>
        <mj-text color="{{colors.text}}" font-size="16px" line-height="24px">{{child_name}} ({{child_email}}) wants to create a {{product_name}} account and gave your email as their parent or guardian.</mj-text>
        <mj-text color="{{colors.text}}" font-size="16px" line-height="24px">We collect their email, username and date of birth, sign-in and security information, and details of the games and apps they use. Read the <a href="{{privacy_summary_url}}" style="color: {{colors.primary}};">plain-language summary</a> or the <a href="{{privacy_url}}" style="color: {{colors.primary}};">full privacy policy</a>.</mj-text>
        <mj-text color="{{colors.text}}" font-size="16px" line-height="24px">If you approve, you'll be able to manage their settings from a family dashboard. If you decline or don't respond by {{expires_at}}, the account and its data are deleted.</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="{{consent_url}}" background-color="{{colors.primary}}" color="{{colors.primary_text}}" font-weight="600" border-radius="8px" align="left" inner-padding="12px 22px">Review and decide</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    {{> footer}}
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
